# Packages whose ELFs go in indium's initramfs, one per line (AGAST #2759).
#
# The one list. Read by indium's Makefile (build/initramfs.tar, run-uefi),
# tools/mkiso.sh and harland/tools/test_tier1_boot.sh; `#` starts a comment.
# init's Tier-1 suite spawns binaries from all of these: prism builds
# hello_gfx, rzsh builds /bin/rzsh. projects/ritz/tools/
# test_indium_initramfs_pkgs.py fails if init spawns a /bin/NAME that no
# package here builds.
indium
rzsh
ritzutils
prism
